      "cooked": "<p>Hey<br>\nCan anyone please help me set up Frappe with Docker without ERPNext?</p>\n<p>I’m trying to build a custom app (e.g., simple product management CRUD). I followed the frappe_docker GitHub instructions, created a new site, app, and installed the app — but ERPNext still loads by default.</p>\n<p>I also updated the hosts file with the site name, but when I visit sitename:8080, I still see ERPNext instead of my custom app.</p>\n<p>If anyone has done this or can guide me, I’d really appreciate it <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/pray.png?v=12\" title=\":pray:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":pray:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
