      "created_at": "2025-05-05T00:35:47.898Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You are trying to develop in a production container.</p>\n<p>Lucky you, I have recently finished preparing a script to spin up a Frappe development container in few clicks, check it out;</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/yamenzk/FrappeDev\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/favicons/favicon.svg\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/yamenzk/FrappeDev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">GitHub</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/344;\"><img src=\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/b4e01bf784bdac92c4042e17182e6e2cb0138d95cbc1954dfaa3f605ac7cc811/yamenzk/FrappeDev\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"690\" height=\"345\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/yamenzk/FrappeDev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">GitHub - yamenzk/FrappeDev</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Contribute to yamenzk/FrappeDev development by creating an account on GitHub.</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><em>You can also use it to create a development instance on Github Codespaces.</em></p>\n<p>Once you finished developing your app, follow <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/frappe_docker/blob/main/docs/custom-apps.md\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this guide</a> to build a custom image (without ERPNext and with your new custom app) so you can setup a production container.</p>",
